    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n'Aisling' is a beautifully maintained home within walking distance of town centre and every local amenity.\n\nIts boast include on-site parking, a detached garage, private gardens to front and rear, many quality internal fixtures and fittings. \n\nIt presents in turn-key condition and would benefit from some mere superficial modernising/upgrading. The property would quality for the vacant property grants.\n\nTo place an offer on this property, register for your mySherryFitz account at SherryFitz.ie."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nReception Hall - 2.389m x 1.897m & 5.569m x 0.943m\nCarpeted. Attic access. Airing press. Storage press. Phone point.\n\nLounge - 3.536m x 3.796m\nCarpeted. Centre light fitting. Tiled fireplace. Corner window. Curtains & rails.\n\nDining Room - 4.084m x 2.469m\nCarpeted. Centre light fitting.\n\nKitchen - 2.738m x 3.163m\nFitted floor and wall units. Marley flooring. Phone point.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.955m x 2.953m\nCarpeted. Curtains & rail. Bulit in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.876m x 1.322m\nCarpeted. Curtains and pole. Bulit in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.956m x 2.905m\nCarpeted. Curtains and pole. Built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.802m x 2.068m\nToilet. Sink. Bath. Tiled floor and walls. Vanity wall press.\n\nShed - 2.656m x 2.613m\nPlumbing. Oil burner.\n\nDetached Garage - 6.083m x 3.219m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil heating</li><li>Double glazing</li><li>An almost maintenance free exterior</ul>"
      },
